## 📊 2026 Architecture Comparison

### OLD (2023 and Earlier)
```
├─ Reactive Forms (FormBuilder, FormControl, FormGroup)
├─ Zone.js change detection (intercepts all async)
├─ Karma test runner (slow, complex setup)
├─ *ngIf, *ngFor, *ngSwitch (implicit behavior)
├─ NgModule-based structure
├─ BehaviorSubject for state management
└─ Manual HttpClientModule import
```

### NEW (2026 Standard)
```
├─ Signal Forms (model() directive, type-safe)
├─ Zoneless change detection (signal-driven)
├─ Vitest test runner (10x faster, simple)
├─ @if, @for, @switch (explicit control flow)
├─ Standalone components (no NgModule)
├─ Signals for state management
└─ HttpClient auto-provided
```

