## 📋 The 10-Minute Interview Cheat Sheet

### Signal Forms (Form 2026)
```typescript
// Two-way binding
user = model<User>({ name: '', email: '' });

// Validation
isValid = computed(() => user().email.includes('@'));

// Template
<input [(ngModel)]="user().email">
<button [disabled]="!isValid()">Save</button>
```

### Signals (State 2026)
```typescript
// Reactive state
count = signal(0);
count.set(5);

// Derived state
doubled = computed(() => count() * 2);

// Side effects
effect(() => console.log(count()));
```

### Zoneless (Change Detection 2026)
```typescript
// Enable in bootstrap
bootstrapApplication(AppComponent, {
  providers: [provideExperimentalZonelessChangeDetection()]
});

// Use signals for state
count = signal(0);
count.set(1); // Triggers change detection precisely
```

### Modern Control Flow (Templates 2026)
```typescript
// Conditional
@if (condition()) { ... } @else { ... }

// Loop
@for (let item of items(); track item.id) { ... }

// Lazy load
@defer (on viewport) { <app-heavy></app-heavy> }
```

### Vitest (Testing 2026)
```typescript
// Config
// vitest.config.ts - minimal setup

// Testing
describe('Service', () => {
  it('should work', () => {
    signal.set(5);
    expect(signal()).toBe(5);
  });
});
```

